OL,5,G0025 World's Deadliest Weather: Caught
OL,6,G     on Camera
OL,7,     FThe region of Emilia-Romagna in
OL,8,     FNorthern Italy is hit by severe
OL,9,     Ffloods after six months' worth of
OL,10,     Frain falls in just 36 hours,
OL,11,     Fengulfing nearby cities and towns.
